<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IA Corp reduced.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IA Corp reduced.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said analyst Ed Caso reduced the rating on IA Corp to market perform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1-1/16 to 3-3/16.</p>
</text>
